+Optional, progressive-enhancement feature on the Lazer archive only. `/lazer/`
+renders **no location control**: the archive header is the shared archive header
+every other listing page renders, and **nothing is requested of the browser on
+page load**, so the browser permission prompt can never appear without an
+explicit visitor action. The location service itself is intact — the one-shot
+geolocation entry point, the Haversine helpers, the two read-only endpoints, the
+global ordering and the distance rendering are unchanged. Once a position is
